{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人氣薄朱專門店!夏日限定新品</p><p>人氣薄朱專門店新推薄荷朱古力蕨餅</p><p>人氣薄荷朱古力專門店悅晨製菓今個夏日新推口感冰涼的薄荷朱古力蕨餅($45/份)，使用日本空運過來蕨粉（非木薯粉），加入冰涼舒爽的薄荷，煮成口感軟Q蕨餅，食落煙煙韌韌，外層沾滿可可粉，薄荷朱古力味香濃，薄朱迷一定要試！</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><p>悅晨製菓 官方IG：@soleiletlune_hk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178470003870252672_18316519226a605c8710956.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178470003986260981_4440117696a605c885cced.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178470004163152289_13161310536a605c8a3a0dc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178470004372161612_20529922136a605c8c7a667.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:31:30.195767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}